msgstr "Gateway"

msgid "WooCommerce POS Pro is now standalone."
msgstr "WooCommerce POS Pro sekarang berdiri sendiri."

msgid ""
"The Pro plugin includes all features from the free version. You can safely "
"deactivate and delete this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Plugin Pro mencakup semua fitur dari versi gratis. Anda dapat menonaktifkan "
"dan menghapus plugin ini dengan aman."

